      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} good, it should be mentioned more often, because while yes, it could be abused, it also would be one of the greatest optimization updates that could ever come to vrchat. If this was a feature you wouldn't have avatars with a whole extra avatar's worth of bs load in every time because like 75% of the avatar could just be items. Like personally I port a bunch of helldiver avatars which usually sit between good to poor ranked, and I *really* don't want to add a gun to any of them because it would immediately push them into the very poor rank.",
